# Firmware

- Real-time gait, IMU, e-stop, and PCA9685 PWM belong on the motion MCU; Uno is Phase 1 bring-up only.
- v1 servo interface is 12 PWM channels on the PCA9685, not a TTL bus.
- UART/USB command protocol from Pi, 50–100 Hz (or faster) servo loop, conservative PWM ranges (no encoder current limits on MG995).
- Never command a walk gait without a hardware e-stop path.
